   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "label": "Read me",
   "options": "<p><b>Verify every value in Qiwa.</b> Nitaqat weightings, the minimum wage for a full Saudi count, which nationalities count as Saudi, and the band thresholds for your economic activity are set by MHRSD and change over time. The values below are commonly published defaults, not official figures for your company. Insight's result is an estimate for management, not the official band.</p>"
